        "content": "# Module 16: FIRST JOB, CTC BREAKDOWN AUR CORPORATE BENEFITS\n\n**(CAMPUS TO CORPORATE FINANCIAL SURVIVAL GUIDE)**\n\nBhai/Behen, congratulations! College ke final year mein placement drive clear ho gayi, campus interview mein HR ne smile karke bola *\"We are happy to offer you a CTC of ₹12 Lakhs Per Annum!\"*, aur tumne instantly apne college WhatsApp group mein status daal diya, *\"Offer Accepted! ₹1 Lakh per month package!\"* Friends ne Zomato/Swiggy pe party maang li, parents ne poore mohalle mein mithai baanti, aur tumne mann hi mann Nifty 50 Index Fund ki SIPs, Ntorq scooter ki EMI, aur iOS vs Android ke flagship phones ke price check karna shuru kar diye.",
