        "content": "Lekin phir tabahi aati hai. Job ke pehle mahine ki 30th date ko jab bank account mein salary credit ka SMS aata hai: *\"Credited INR 81,800\"*, tum deep shock mein chale jaate ho. Tum screen ko baar baar refresh karke dekhte ho aur sochte ho: *\"Bhai! ₹12 Lakhs divided by 12 months toh exact ₹1,00,000 per month hona chahiye tha! Mere ₹18,200 per month kahan gaye? Kya HR ne dhokha diya? Kya company ne fraudulent cut mara? Ya government ne saara paisa Income Tax mein hi kaat liya?\"*\n\nWelcome to the real corporate world!\n\nCorporate salary structure ek multi-dimensional jigsaw puzzle ki tarah hota hai jismein HR managers and compensation teams components ko iss tarah arrange karte hain ki CTC offer letter pe maximum, shiny aur impressive dikhe, lekin actual bank balance modest real values mein credit ho. Is module mein hum placement offer letter ke single line CTC se lekar PF passbook, ESOP vesting schedules, tax deductions, corporate perks, flexi benefit baskets aur layoff severance packages tak **sab kuch surgical precision ke saath decode karenge**.",
