        "title": "Real Indian Case Studies & Salary Calculator Worksheets",
        "content": "Aao 5 detailed Indian real-life job profiles aur exact mathematical worksheets ke sath saare concepts summarize karte hain.\n\n---\n\n### 16.6.1 Case Study 1: Software Engineer Amit (₹15 LPA CTC - Tier 1 Product MNC, Bengaluru)\n\nAmit 22 saal ka Software Development Engineer (SDE-1) hai Bengaluru mein.\n\n#### Table 16.11: Amit's ₹15 LPA Detailed Salary Sheet\n\n| Component | Annual (₹) | Monthly (₹) | Notes / Remarks |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Basic Salary** | ₹7,50,000 | ₹62,500 | 50% of CTC |\n| **HRA** | ₹3,75,000 | ₹31,250 | 50% of Basic |\n| **Special Allowance** | ₹1,61,000 | ₹13,417 | Balance Plug |\n| **LTA** | ₹30,000 | ₹2,500 | Claimable via Bills |\n| **Employer EPF (12%)** | ₹90,000 | ₹7,500 | 12% of Basic |\n| **Gratuity Pool** | ₹36,058 | ₹3,005 | Statutory provision |\n| **Performance Variable Bonus** | ₹57,942 | ₹4,828 | Annual Payout (Target 100%) |\n| **TOTAL CTC PACKAGE** | **₹15,00,000** | **₹1,25,000** | **Gross CTC** |\n\n#### Monthly Take-Home Math for Amit:\n\n- **Gross Monthly Earnings Cash:** Basic (₹62.5k) + HRA (₹31.25k) + Special Allow (₹13.417k) + LTA (₹2.5k) = **₹1,09,667**\n- **Deductions:**\n  - Employee EPF (12%): ₹7,500\n  - Professional Tax: ₹200\n  - TDS (New Tax Regime Option Selected): Approx ₹8,400 / month\n- **NET MONTHLY IN-HAND SALARY = ₹1,09,667 - (₹7,500 + ₹200 + ₹8,400) = ₹93,567 / month**\n\n> **Insight:** ₹15 LPA CTC package par Amit ka actual bank take-home monthly payout **₹93,567** hai.\n\n---\n\n### 16.6.2 Case Study 2: Management Trainee Sneha (₹8 LPA CTC - FMCG Sector, Mumbai)\n\nSneha ne MBA ke baad FMCG company mein Management Trainee role start kiya Mumbai mein.\n\n#### Table 16.12: Sneha's ₹8 LPA Salary Breakdown & Take-Home\n\n| Component Head | Annual Amount (₹) | Monthly Amount (₹) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Basic Salary** | ₹3,20,000 | ₹26,667 |\n| **HRA** | ₹1,60,000 | ₹13,333 |\n| **Special Allowance** | ₹1,55,200 | ₹12,933 |\n| **Flexi Benefits (Fuel/Phone)**| ₹60,000 | ₹5,000 |\n| **Employer EPF Contribution**| ₹38,400 | ₹3,200 |\n| **Gratuity Reserve** | ₹15,400 | ₹1,283 |\n| **Annual Retention Bonus** | ₹51,000 | ₹4,250 (Paid at Year End) |\n| **TOTAL CTC** | **₹8,00,000** | **₹66,667** |",
        "color": "#2563eb",
        "emoji": "💼",
