        "title": "Real Indian Case Studies & Salary Calculator Worksheets (Part 2)",
        "content": "#### Monthly Take-Home Math for Sneha:\n- Gross Monthly Direct Cash = ₹26,667 + ₹13,333 + ₹12,933 + ₹5,000 = **₹57,933**\n- Deductions:\n  - Employee EPF: ₹3,200\n  - Professional Tax: ₹200\n  - Income Tax TDS (Old Regime with HRA rent ₹18,000 in Mumbai + 80C ₹1.5L): Approx ₹1,100 / month\n- **NET MONTHLY IN-HAND SALARY = ₹57,933 - (₹3,200 + ₹200 + ₹1,100) = ₹53,433 / month**\n\n---\n\n### 16.6.3 Case Study 3: IT Ops Associate Kunal (₹3.5 LPA CTC - BPO/IT Services, Noida)\n\nKunal Tier-3 city se graduate hokar IT Support Operations join karta hai Noida mein.\n\n#### Table 16.13: Kunal's ₹3.5 LPA CTC Breakdown\n\n| Component Head | Annual Amount (₹) | Monthly Amount (₹) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Basic Salary** | ₹1,80,000 | ₹15,000 (Statutory Base) |\n| **HRA** | ₹72,000 | ₹6,000 |\n| **Conveyance / Special Allowance**| ₹51,800 | ₹4,317 |\n| **Employer EPF Contribution**| ₹21,600 | ₹1,800 |\n| **Employer ESI / Insurance** | ₹18,000 | ₹1,500 |\n| **Gratuity** | ₹6,600 | ₹550 |\n| **TOTAL CTC** | **₹3,50,000** | **₹29,167** |\n\n#### Monthly Take-Home Math for Kunal:\n- Gross Monthly Direct Cash = ₹15,000 + ₹6,000 + ₹4,317 = **₹25,317**\n- Deductions:\n  - Employee EPF (12% of ₹15,000): ₹1,800\n  - ESI Employee Contribution: ₹190\n  - Income Tax TDS: **₹0** (FY 2025-26 New Regime mein Rebate under Sec 87A keeps tax zero up to ₹12 Lakhs taxable income — Budget Feb 2025 ne limit ₹7L se badha kar ₹12L kar di!)\n  - Professional Tax: ₹0 (Noida / UP no PT)\n- **NET MONTHLY IN-HAND SALARY = ₹25,317 - (₹1,800 + ₹190) = ₹23,327 / month**\n\n---\n\n### 16.6.4 Case Study 4: Early-Stage Startup Employee Rohan (₹10L Cash + ₹5L ESOPs, Gurgaon)\n\nRohan early-stage Fintech startup join karta hai Gurgaon mein. Offer: **₹10 LPA Fixed Cash + ₹5 LPA ESOPs (vested over 4 years)**.\n\n#### Table 16.14: Rohan's CTC Structure Realities\n\n| Component Head | Offer Value (LPA) | Real Year-1 Cash Reality |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Fixed Cash Components** | ₹10,00,000 | Monthly In-hand ~₹71,500 |\n| **ESOP Paper Value** | ₹5,00,000 | Year 1 Cliff = 25% Vested = **₹0 CASH** |\n| **Total Stated Offer** | **₹15,00,000** | **Real Cash In Hand = ₹71,500 / month** |\n\n- **Rohan's Strategic Blueprint:** Rohan clear vision rakhta hai ki pehle saal uska actual cash baseline ₹10 Lakhs fixed package hi hai. ESOPs ko liquidity event hone par multi-bagger upside ki tarah treat karega, baseline living expenses fixed salary ke in-hand pay (₹71.5k) se manage karega.\n\n---",
